  "description": "Service ID\u202f1234567890123456, supplied by vendor\u202f12345 under the SCS lot, is the **Advanced Cloud Monitoring Service**. The service definition, terms and conditions, and pricing details are available at the following URLs respectively: https://example.com/service\u2011definition.pdf, https://example.com/terms.pdf and https://example.com/pricing.pdf. This offering provides real\u2011time monitoring and alerts for cloud infrastructure to ensure high availability and performance, as summarised in the service description: *Provides real\u2011time monitoring and alerts for cloud infrastructure to ensure high availability and performance*.\n\nThe service is delivered as both **Implementation** and **Ongoing support**. Key features include a real\u2011time metrics dashboard, automated alerting, and customizable thresholds, while the primary benefits are improved system reliability, reduced downtime costs, and scalable monitoring across environments. Pricing starts at **\u00a399 per licence per month** (price string \u201c\u00a399 per licence per month\u201d), with a minimum price of\u202f99.0\u202fGBP; no maximum price is defined (price max\u202f=\u202fnull). The price unit is \u201cLicence\u201d, VAT is included, education pricing does not apply, and a termination\u2011cost clause is in place. The minimum contract period is one **Month**.\n\nSupport is provided through a **Service desk**, **Email**, and **Phone**, and it covers third\u2011party products. Availability is described as \u201c24/7 availability during business days and holidays\u201d, with an initial response time of \u201cInitial response within 2\u202fhours for critical incidents\u201d. Incident escalation is enabled, ensuring any serious issues are promptly escalated."
